  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0028_ac6314c540b4.png\"/> <br >In tert-butyl cation, carbon bearing <math> <mrow> <mo>⊕</mo> </mrow> </math> charge has one vacant p orbital hence it is <math> <mrow> <mtext>σ</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>p</mtext> </mrow> </math> (empty) conjugation or Hyperconjugation.<br ><img src=\"assets\\st0028_f45c17dba376.png\"/> <br >In 2-butene hyperconjugation between ​<math> <mrow> <mtext>σ</mtext> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>π</mtext> <mo>*</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> bond."
